{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32614","headline":"题巫山庙 · 刘沧","name":"题巫山庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十二岚峯挂夕晖，庙门深闭雾烟微。\n天高木落楚人思，山迥月残神女归。\n触石晴云凝翠鬓，度江寒雨湿罗衣。\n婵娟似恨襄王梦，猨呌断岩秋藓稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}